Design decisions:
- Zod (not class-validator) at the API boundary via ZodValidationPipe; shared-types is type-only.
- bcryptjs (not bcrypt): no native builds, installs everywhere.
- No lockfile shipped: scaffolded projects generate + commit their own pnpm-lock.yaml.
- Placeholder: __PROJECT_SLUG__ (package names + titles), replaced by scripts/scaffold.sh.

